WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:05.100
- When you meditate, we're
all human, we're all mortal.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.920
When you meditate on your own mortality,

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:13.920
having achieved a lot of
success on whatever dimension,

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.360
what do you think is
the meaning of it all,

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:21.360
the meaning of our short existence
on Earth as human beings?

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:24.500
- I think that evolution
is the greatest force

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.500
in the universe, and
that we're all tiny bits

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.080
of an evolutionary type of
process where it's just matter

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.080
and machines that go through
time, and that we all have

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:44.340
a deeply embedded inclination

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.860
to evolve and contribute to evolution.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:51.390
So I think it's to personally evolve

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.640
and contribute to evolution.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.550
- I could have predicted
you would answer that way.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.743
It's brilliant and exactly right.

